  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5bb8abeb8477f3d47aac6a4d0e488fcf, type: 3}
  m_Name: EN
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp-firstpass::Daniel.Master.DialogueData
  DialogueNumber: 4
  Language: EN
  Lines:
  - Is anyone there? Hello?
  - Hey, are you okay?
  - Come on, get up.
  - Oh, I don't think your glasses survived the earthquake. Well, at least you seem
    to be unharmed.
  - There's no one else here but us. Let's go look for the others together.
  - Your friend is surely out there somewhere, just like the rest of my bandmates.
  - I'll follow you!
